{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51614","headline":"感怀 · 潘佑","name":"感怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽禽唤杜宇，宿蝶梦庄周。\n席地一尊酒，思与元化浮。\n但莫孤明月，何必秉烛游。\n（〖1〗见《法藏碎金录》卷六。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"潘佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51614.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51614","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}